    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "We are delighted to bring this well kept and superbly located bungalow to the market. Situated in a quiet rural setting the property has easy walking access to the local Londis Shop and has an excellent Bus service to Dundalk Newry and Carlingford  (160 & 161). With a thriving National school, Community Centre and Sports Club -everything is nearby. There are also school buses to Dundalk, Bush and Newry. The bungalow nests on a large site that is approached down a leafy tarmac lane and has good off road parking and a very large back garden with separate field gate. This allows easy access for cars and trailers. The interior area is boosted by 2 large rooms in the attic space and toiler. Downstairs the main living area gives easy circulation and 2 large windows afford great views over the surrounding countryside and on to Dundalk.  There are 3 Bedrooms and a fully tiled Family Bathroom. There is good Utility space as well. Viewing is strongly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance porch that is tiled and has an outer sliding door"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Inner Hall - 3.36m x 1.66m \r\nStairs to dormer space and corridor to Bedrooms 4.75 mts long.\nLaminate floor\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 3.95m x 3.33m \r\nFeature Fireplace with marble surround, Cast iron and tiled inset. Timber Floor\r\n\r\nKitchen / Living / Diner - 8.57m x 3.35m \r\nFitted Oak Kitchen units with integrated Hob and Oven, 2 large picture windows. Smart \"in fireplace\" Stove. Part timber /part tiled floor. Door to back hall area \r\n\r\nBack Hall - 2.56m x 1.35m \r\nTiled floor\r\n\r\nW.C - 1.56m x 0.87m \r\nW.C., W.H.B. tiled floor\r\n\r\nUtility - 4.68m x 3.68m \r\nPlumbed for Washing machine\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.49m x 2.84m \r\nLaminated floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.95m x 2.84m \r\nLarge built in wardrobes with vanity unit.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.89m x 2.87m \r\n\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom - 2.3m x 2.01m \r\nFully tiled walls and floor.\nBath, Electric Shower, W.H.B. and W.C.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Smartly presented 3 Bed 2 Rec Bungalow wit additional dormer space.\r\nVery picturesque area in Ravensdale and leafy laneway approach\r\nLarge garden with second entrance.\r\nNear Shop, Bus Routes and Local Amenities.\r\nDouble Glazed, Private Well and Septic tank.\r\nCeiling cornices throughout."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Turn off old Newry road at the Waterworks junction Where road has a sharp left  hand corner (arrows on the wall) take the lane to the right (about 30mt s) after bend - Lane narrows and the property is about 80mts on the right."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Strictly by day before appointment"
      }
